      "reason": "plan N-1, N-2: a repository is named after the one thing it handles, in the singular, and a library of one part of an HTTP message has the prefix http-, so the repository is http-cookie; design P-1 and E-2 give its package, module and error class names: Composer polyspec/http-cookie, PHP Polyspec\\HttpCookie, PyPI polyspec-http-cookie, Python polyspec.http_cookie, npm @polyspec/http-cookie, PHP extension polyspec_http_cookie, the error classes HttpCookie<Category>Error in PHP and Node and HTTPCookie<Category>Error in Python (N-2: an acronym word is one capital word in PHP and Node and all capitals in Python)",
